// Application manifest and icon of dofscroll.exe (asInvoker, long paths, UTF-8 active code page).
// 1 = CREATEPROCESS_MANIFEST_RESOURCE_ID, 24 = RT_MANIFEST (numeric: no header needed).
1 24 "dofscroll.manifest"
// 1 = the application icon (lowest id: Explorer, taskbar and the Start menu shortcut use it). Made by
// scripts/make-windows-ico.py from icons/dofscroll-app.svg.
1 ICON "dofscroll.ico"
